ntend a plan? But those who disbelieve - they are the object of a plan.","w":[{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"Or"},{"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","tr":"yurīdūna","en":"(do) they intend","root":"رود","lem":"أَرادَ"},{"ar":"كَيْدًۭا ۖ","tr":"kaydan","en":"a plot","root":"كيد","lem":"كَيْد"},{"ar":"فَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"fa-alladhīna","en":"But those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieve","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"هُمُ","tr":"humu","en":"themselves"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَكِيدُونَ","tr":"l-makīdūna","en":"(are in) the plot","root":"كيد","lem":"مَكِيد"}]},{"n":43,"juz":27,"ar":"أَمْ لَهُمْ إِلَـٰهٌ غَيْرُ ٱللَّهِ ۚ سُبْحَـٰنَ ٱللَّهِ عَمَّا يُشْرِكُونَ","en":"Or have they a deity other than Allāh? Exalted is Allāh above whatever they associate with Him.","w":[{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"Or"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"for them"},{"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌ","tr":"ilāhun","en":"a god","root":"أله","lem":"إِلٰه"},{"ar":"غَيْرُ","tr":"ghayru","en":"other than","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"سُبْحَـٰنَ","tr":"sub'ḥāna","en":"Glory be","root":"سبح","lem":"سُبْحان"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(to) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَمَّا","tr":"ʿammā","en":"from what"},{"ar":"يُشْرِكُونَ","tr":"yush'rikūna","en":"they associate (with Him)","root":"شرك","lem":"أَشْرَكَ"}]},{"n":44,"juz":27,"ar":"وَإِن يَرَوْا۟ كِسْفًا مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ سَاقِطًا يَقُولُوا۟ سَحَابٌ مَّرْكُومٌ","en":"And if they were to see a fragment from the sky falling, they would say, \"[It is merely] clouds heaped up.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"And if"},{"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","tr":"yaraw","en":"they were to see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"كِسْفًۭا","tr":"kis'fan","en":"a portion","root":"كسف","lem":"كِسْف"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"l-samāi","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"سَاقِطًۭا","tr":"sāqiṭan","en":"falling","root":"سقط","lem":"ساقِط"},{"ar":"يَقُولُوا۟","tr":"yaqūlū","en":"they will say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"سَحَابٌۭ","tr":"saḥābun","en":"Clouds","root":"سحب","lem":"سَحاب"},{"ar":"مَّرْكُومٌۭ","tr":"markūmun","en":"heaped up","root":"ركم","lem":"مَرْكُوم"}]},{"n":45,"juz":27,"ar":"فَذَرْهُمْ حَتَّىٰ يُلَـٰقُوا۟ يَوْمَهُمُ ٱلَّذِى فِيهِ يُصْعَقُونَ","en":"So leave them until they meet their Day in which they will be struck insensible -","w":[{"ar":"فَذَرْهُمْ","tr":"fadharhum","en":"So leave them","root":"وذر","lem":"يَذَرَ"},{"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","tr":"ḥattā","en":"until"},{"ar":"يُلَـٰقُوا۟","tr":"yulāqū","en":"they meet","root":"لقي","lem":"يُلاقُ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَهُمُ","tr":"yawmahumu","en":"their Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"which"},{"ar":"فِيهِ","tr":"fīhi","en":"in it"},{"ar":"يُصْعَقُونَ","tr":"yuṣ'ʿaqūna","en":"they will faint","root":"صعق","lem":"صَعِقَ"}]},{"n":46,"juz":27,"ar":"يَوْمَ لَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُمْ كَيْدُهُمْ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا هُمْ يُنصَرُونَ","en":"The Day their plan will not avail them at all, nor will they be helped.","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(The) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"يُغْنِى","tr":"yugh'nī","en":"will avail","root":"غني","lem":"أَغْنَتْ"},{"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","tr":"ʿanhum","en":"to them"},{"ar":"كَيْدُهُمْ","tr":"kayduhum","en":"their plotting","root":"كيد","lem":"كَيْد"},{"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","tr":"shayan","en":"(in) anything","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"يُنصَرُونَ","tr":"yunṣarūna","en":"will be helped","root":"نصر","lem":"نَصَرَ"}]},{"n":47,"juz":27,"ar":"وَإِنَّ لِلَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا۟ عَذَابًا دُونَ ذَٰلِكَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en":"And indeed, for those who have wronged is a punishment before that, but most of them do not know.","w":[{"ar":"وَإِنَّ","tr":"wa-inna","en":"And indeed"},{"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","tr":"lilladhīna","en":"for those who"},{"ar":"ظَلَمُوا۟","tr":"ẓalamū","en":"do wrong","root":"ظلم","lem":"ظَلَمَ"},{"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","tr":"ʿadhāban","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"دُونَ","tr":"dūna","en":"before","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","tr":"walākinna","en":"but"},{"ar":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","tr":"aktharahum","en":"most of them","root":"كثر","lem":"أَكْثَر"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"yaʿlamūna","en":"know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"}]},{"n":48,"juz":27,"ar":"وَٱصْبِرْ لِحُكْمِ رَبِّكَ فَإِنَّكَ بِأَعْيُنِنَا ۖ وَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِ رَبِّكَ حِينَ تَقُومُ","en":"And be patient, [O Muḥammad], for the decision of your Lord, for indeed, you are in Our eyes [i.e., sight]. And exalt [Allāh] with praise of your Lord when you arise","w":[{"ar":"وَٱصْبِرْ","tr":"wa-iṣ'bir","en":"So be patient","root":"صبر","lem":"صَبَرَ"},{"ar":"لِحُكْمِ","tr":"liḥuk'mi","en":"for (the) Command","root":"حكم","lem":"حُكْم"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّكَ","tr":"fa-innaka","en":"for indeed, you"},{"ar":"بِأَعْيُنِنَا ۖ","tr":"bi-aʿyuninā","en":"(are) in Our Eyes","root":"عين","lem":"عَيْن"},{"ar":"وَسَبِّحْ","tr":"wasabbiḥ","en":"And glorify","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"بِحَمْدِ","tr":"biḥamdi","en":"(the) praise","root":"حمد","lem":"حَمْد"},{"ar":"رَبِّكَ","tr":"rabbika","en":"(of) your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"حِينَ","tr":"ḥīna","en":"when","root":"حين","lem":"حِين"},{"ar":"تَقُومُ","tr":"taqūmu","en":"you arise","root":"قوم","lem":"قامَ"}]},{"n":49,"juz":27,"ar":"وَمِنَ ٱلَّيْلِ فَسَبِّحْهُ وَإِدْبَـٰرَ ٱلنُّجُومِ","en":"And in a part of the night exalt Him and after [the setting of] the stars.","w":[{"ar":"وَمِنَ","tr":"wamina","en":"And of"},{"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"al-layli","en":"the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"فَسَبِّحْهُ","tr":"fasabbiḥ'hu","en":"glorify Him","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"وَإِدْبَـٰرَ","tr":"wa-id'bāra","